# Color Usage Guidelines

## 🚫 CRITICAL: NEVER APPLY COLORS DIRECTLY

**ABSOLUTE RULE: Agents must NEVER apply colors in any form.**

### ❌ FORBIDDEN
```tsx
// ❌ NO direct colors, Tailwind color classes, or CSS colors
style={{ color: '#FF0000' }}
className="gba:text-red-500 gba:bg-blue-100"
<div style={{ backgroundColor: 'white' }}>
```

### ✅ CORRECT: Use @newwork/nw-design-system Only

**ALL colors MUST come from design system component variants:**

```tsx
// ✅ Use semantic component variants
<Button type="primary">Primary</Button>
<Button danger>Danger</Button>
<Alert type="success" message="Success" />
<Alert type="error" message="Error" />
<Badge status="success" text="Active" />
<Tag color="success">Success</Tag>
```

### ✅ Layout & Spacing Only
```tsx
// ✅ You MAY use non-color Tailwind classes
className="gba:flex gba:items-center gba:p-4 gba:rounded-lg"
```

### 🚨 Enforcement
- **NO** hex codes, color names, or Tailwind color classes
- **YES** to design system component types/variants only
- When in doubt, use default variants

The `@newwork/nw-design-system` handles all colors - let it do its job!

